    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are delighted to bring 79 Avondale Park to the sales market. The convenience of Avondale Park, less than a 5 minute walk from Raheny Village and it is well serviced by local buses on the Howth Road and DART station access. This beautifully maintained house offers light filled accommodation, well proportioned accommodation extending to c. 89sq.m. There is off street parking to front and the property is further complimented by a secluded rear garden enjoying a westerly orientation, ideal for outdoor living and entertaining. Viewing of this home is strongly recommended. \n\nThis mature location is simply superb, less than 5 minutes walk from Raheny Village & DART station. There are a large choice of local amenities schools, crèche, restaurants, coffee shops, churches and library. There are many sports clubs in the locality GAA, golf, football to name but a few. Well served by bus and train links to Dublin City Centre, Dublin International Airport and M1/M50 motorways are easily accessible. St. Anne` Park, promenade cycle track and walkway are close by."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch Entrance\nPVC sliding porch door.\n\nReception Hall\nPorcelain floor tiles.\n\nLounge/Dining Room - 7.74m (25'5\") x 3.48m (11'5\")\nDual aspect. Laminate flooring.\n\nKitchen - 3.75m (12'4\") x 2.1m (6'11\")\nExtensive range of high gloss fitted press units. Under counter lighting. Plumbed for dishwasher & washing machine. Porcelain floor tiles. Floor lighting. PVC door to rear.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.95m (13'0\") x 3.55m (11'8\")\nSliderobes. Laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.67m (12'0\") x 3.32m (10'11\")\nLaminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.67m (8'9\") x 2.61m (8'7\")\nLaminate flooring.\n\nBathroom\nBath, screen, whb, wc and electric shower. Fully tiled floor & walls. Recessed lighting.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> PVC double glazed windows </li><li> Oil central heating (newly fitted boiler) </li><li> Insulated attic </li><li> Off street parking </li><li> Westerly rear orientation </li><li> Patio area </li><li> Concrete shed </li><li> Side access </li><li> Outside tap</li></ul>"
      },
